# Never let real secrets or local dev artifacts into the build context —
# found missing during the Step 9 audit; without this, `COPY . .` in the
# Dockerfile would copy .env.local (real Auth0 secrets) straight into a
# build layer, exactly the "accidentally-baked-in secrets" class of bug
# the Step 9 Bug Sweep explicitly calls out to check for.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

node_modules
.next
out

.git
.gitignore

*.md
!README.md

.vscode
.idea

npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
